    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Idle Frontier,\u00a0an idle cultivation &amp; village-building game where you become the divine architect of a mystical realm. Build your settlement, manage resources, train cultivators, and breathe new life into a hidden paradise. Your laid-back path to immortality begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card-Based Building, Village by Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to build and expand your village. Every layout choice\u2014from lumber camps to mining spots, from villager tasks to strategic upgrades\u2014shapes your unique immortal haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/23ab44633bd94d92620bffecb6a32afb.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/23ab44633bd94d92620bffecb6a32afb.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate While You Slack, Optimize Every Minute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimize the game to keep it running in the background. Sneak in some village progress while you \u201cwork\u201d\u2014a true harmony of productivity and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/8ed1a824703aa75a41b136958bfb80e6.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/8ed1a824703aa75a41b136958bfb80e6.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Unknown, Battle Your Way Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and step into dynamic encounters\u2014random events, deadly foes, and mini-game challenges await. Each decision brings new rewards\u2026 or risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/ca25882a8e20dd19ded9ad79e3125c19.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/ca25882a8e20dd19ded9ad79e3125c19.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Systems, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From refining pills and forging gear to mastering sect techniques and talent trees\u2014interwoven systems keep the gameplay rich and rewarding across all fronts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/c2ef34c6b5dd62be2a4a90f18bfed799.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/c2ef34c6b5dd62be2a4a90f18bfed799.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effortless Idling, Resources Flow In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and let the world work for you. Resources are gathered automatically, even when you're offline. Tap to grow, click to ascend\u2014cultivation has never been this chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Cultivation Journey Begins With a Tap. Idle progression, creative building\u2014relax and enjoy the life of an immortal pioneer, anytime and anywhere.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Idle Frontier,\u00a0an idle cultivation &amp; village-building game where you become the divine architect of a mystical realm. Build your settlement, manage resources, train cultivators, and breathe new life into a hidden paradise. Your laid-back path to immortality begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card-Based Building, Village by Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to build and expand your village. Every layout choice\u2014from lumber camps to mining spots, from villager tasks to strategic upgrades\u2014shapes your unique immortal haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/23ab44633bd94d92620bffecb6a32afb.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/23ab44633bd94d92620bffecb6a32afb.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultivate While You Slack, Optimize Every Minute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimize the game to keep it running in the background. Sneak in some village progress while you \u201cwork\u201d\u2014a true harmony of productivity and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/8ed1a824703aa75a41b136958bfb80e6.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/8ed1a824703aa75a41b136958bfb80e6.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Unknown, Battle Your Way Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and step into dynamic encounters\u2014random events, deadly foes, and mini-game challenges await. Each decision brings new rewards\u2026 or risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/ca25882a8e20dd19ded9ad79e3125c19.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/ca25882a8e20dd19ded9ad79e3125c19.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Systems, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From refining pills and forging gear to mastering sect techniques and talent trees\u2014interwoven systems keep the gameplay rich and rewarding across all fronts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/c2ef34c6b5dd62be2a4a90f18bfed799.poster.avif?t=1749708922\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224850/extras/c2ef34c6b5dd62be2a4a90f18bfed799.webm?t=1749708922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effortless Idling, Resources Flow In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and let the world work for you. Resources are gathered automatically, even when you're offline. Tap to grow, click to ascend\u2014cultivation has never been this chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Cultivation Journey Begins With a Tap. Idle progression, creative building\u2014relax and enjoy the life of an immortal pioneer, anytime and anywhere.</p>",
    "short_description": "This idle game blends card-based building, resource management, and relaxed gameplay. Expand your village, master sect skills, explore realms, and enjoy offline rewards. Effortless fun awaits\u2014start your journey to immortality!",
